<title>USA: TENNIS-FINAL RESULT FROM ARIZONA MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FINAL RESULT FROM ARIZONA MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Arizona</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the</p>
<p>singles final at the $328,000 Arizona Tennis Classic on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat 8-Richey Reneberg (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
